  "body": "THE BEST THINGS ARE HIDDEN FOR A REASON…\r\n\r\nYOUR MILFORD HIDEAWAY - BRAND NEW, PRICED TO GO!\r\n\r\nNo driveway parking. No problem? Read on…\r\n\r\nSome homes are all about the car. This one is all about where your feet can take you.\r\nTucked away at the end of the driveway, this brand-new three-bedroom unit is your own little hidden gem in the heart of Milford. A private sanctuary that puts the best of the neighbourhood within easy walking distance - Milford Beach, the shopping centre, your morning coffee fix and public transport just steps away at the top of the driveway.\r\nThink less time behind the wheel and more time enjoying the lifestyle you moved here for.\r\nAnd because good things come in threes, we have three more reasons to take a closer look:\r\n\r\n1.BRAND NEW. Fresh, modern and ready for you to move straight in.\r\n\r\n2.  DOUBLE WESTLAKE SCHOOL ZONE. A sought-after location in zone for both Westlake Boys and Westlake Girls High Schools, adding another serious advantage to this clever buying opportunity.\r\n\r\n3. TWO YEARS OF BODY CORPORATE FEES PAID. That's two years of one less expense to worry about.\r\n\r\n\r\nBUY WITH YOUR MATES. LIVE TOGETHER. GET A FOOT ON THE LADDER.\r\nWhy buy alone when you could buy together? With three bedrooms, this could be the perfect opportunity to purchase with friends, share the costs and enjoy a Milford lifestyle that might otherwise feel out of reach. Think your own place, your own space and your mates under one roof - all while getting into the property market together. Now that's a smart move!\r\n\r\nNow for the part you really need to know: this is the final one, our vendors are serious about selling, and the price has been sharpened to make this opportunity even harder to ignore.\r\n\r\nIs it for everyone? Perhaps not. But if you value location, low-maintenance living and a brand-new home over having a car parked at your front door, this could be exactly what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nMilford. Brand new. Three bedrooms. Two years' body corporate fees paid. $5,000 furniture voucher. Seriously sharp buying.\r\nHidden gems don't stay hidden forever. Come and see what's waiting at the bottom of the driveway.\r\n\r\n\r\nLOT 1 - SOLD\r\nLOT 2 - SOLD\r\nLOT 3 - SOLD \r\nLOT 4 - SOLD\r\nLOT 5 - SOLD\r\nLOT 6 - SOLD \r\nLOT 6B - AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n16E Dallinghoe Crescent, Milford\r\nhttp://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34660",
